<rml>
<head>
    <title>navcheck unreachable</title>
    <!-- The planted failure (ui_navcheck, phase 94): a button laid over the edge of another, so
         no direction from anywhere lands on it. Listing this document in the check must fail the
         build with "#orphan unreachable". It is not in the check's list; it is the proof that
         the gate bites, run with ui_navcheck --also unreachable.rml. -->
    <style>
        body { display: block; padding: 24dp; font-family: Bricolage Grotesque; font-size: 16dp; color: #e8f0ee; }
        button { display: block; position: absolute; width: 200dp; height: 40dp; background-color: #172126; }
        .is-f { background-color: #c6ff3d; color: #0c1215; }
        #first { left: 24dp; top: 24dp; }
        #orphan { left: 124dp; top: 44dp; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <button id="first">First</button>
    <button id="orphan">Orphan</button>
</body>
</rml>
